OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh Green Party leader Anthony
OL,4,ASlaughter diagnosed with cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of the Green Party in Wales
OL,7,Fhas been diagnosed with cancer, the
OL,8,Fparty has said.
OL,10,FAnthony Slaughter underwent surgery
OL,11,Fover the Senedd recess in the summer as
OL,12,Fpart of his treatment.
OL,14,FHe told a late Senedd debate that he
OL,15,Fhad a "scheduled and serious operation"
OL,16,F- his party said his recovery is going
OL,17,Fwell.
OL,19,FThe MS for Caerdydd Penarth is one of
OL,20,Ftwo Greens in the Senedd elected in May
OL,21,F- the first to be elected to the Welsh
OL,22,FParliament.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
